<title>USA: ISG unaware of reason for shr activity.</title>
<headline>ISG unaware of reason for shr activity.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Mass. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>ISG International Software Group Ltd said on Thursday that it is unaware of any material events or circumstances that would hurt its business or prospects.</p>
<p>The company said it was responding to recent market activity in its stock.</p>
<p>ISG International's shares closed at 12-1/8 on Wednesday. The stock's 52-week high was 37-3/8 and the low for the period was 6-1/4.</p>
</text>
